# ============================================================================
# DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST
# ============================================================================
# Before deploying to production, ensure:
#
# [x] All GENERATE_WITH_OPENSSL placeholders replaced with actual secrets
# [x] All REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_* placeholders filled in
# [x] At least one LLM provider API key configured
# [x] Database credentials set and PostgreSQL accessible
# [x] PC-specific variables configured for each of 4 PCs
# [x] Critical secrets stored in Infisical
# [x] .env file added to .gitignore
# [x] Different secrets used for dev/staging/production
# [x] Network connectivity verified between all 4 PCs
# [x] Firewall rules configured for required ports
# [x] Tailscale mesh VPN established (optional but recommended)
# [x] Monitoring stack accessible (Grafana, Prometheus)
#
# For detailed documentation, see: docs/environment/MASTER-ENV-VARS.md
# ============================================================================
